{"t":"Grothmok Tunnel","s":"grothmok-tunnel-638e3","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_map_f9b575.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>These tunnels were sealed off due to a cave in which killed the famous dwarven kisser Shearton Softbeard.\n</p><p>This tunnel is full of Ghosts and to the west is the NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Dwarven%20Ghost\">a dwarven ghost</a> which is part of a quest (at the light blue spot).\nLocation of the <a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grothmok Tunnel map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"168\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_map_f9b575.jpg\" width=\"270\"/></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Grothmok Tunnel NPCs (1)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Dwarven%20Ghost\">A Dwarven Ghost</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Dwarven%20Ghost\"><img alt=\"A Dwarven Ghost\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Dwarven_Ghost_026007.gif\" width=\"112\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Unknown Occupation</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Grothmok%20Tunnel\">Grothmok tunnels</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Grothmok Tunnel Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\"><img alt=\"Ghost\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghost_4a39b7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghost</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">120</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">125 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">80 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">45 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Herb\">Shadow Herb</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morning%20Star\">Morning Star</a></li>\n<li>Cape</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Combat%20Knife\">Combat Knife</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">White Piece of Cloth</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Ghostly Tissue (rare)</li>\n<li>Book (Orange) (rare)</li>\n<li>Ancient Shield (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-How_to_get_to_the_tunnel\">How to get to the tunnel</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Walk to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarven Mines</a> and enter <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32531,31914,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32531, 31914, 7)</a>.</li>\n<li>Walk a bit north and go down the hole:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grothmok Tunnel -1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_1_aa66da.png\" width=\"187\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Walk west, take the lower passage and go down a hole again:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grothmok Tunnel -2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"145\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_2_d3549b.png\" width=\"244\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go down the nearest hole you see, it is only 2 squares away (no image)</li>\n<li>Walk west, you will meet <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldiers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, go down another hole:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grothmok Tunnel -4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"164\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_4_fdde55.png\" width=\"189\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You're almost there now, fight of 3-4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guards</a>, walk a little south, and to your west there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Door%20%28Sealed%29\">sealed door</a> (you need permission to enter from <a href=\"#/wiki/Budrik\">Budrik</a>) with the Grothmok Tunnel behind it:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Grothmok Tunnel -5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"179\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Grothmok_Tunnel_5_f34990.png\" width=\"176\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>You will encounter a total of 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghosts</a> in the tunnel, in company of NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Dwarven%20Ghost\">A Dwarven Ghost</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a></p></div></div>","quests":["kissing-a-pig-quest"]}